        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "180. Meals must be taken during the hour before work, the designated lunch period or the hour following quitting time. If meals are not available during these periods, a credit shall be given to such employee amounting to one dollar ($1.00) for each unavailable meal.",
